# Backend base URL - must be absolute and HTTPS (see src/config.ts for why).
# Copy this file to .env and adjust for how you're running the app.
#
# Default / recommended: the Azure-hosted backend, which has a trusted TLS
# cert and needs no local setup:
API_BASE_URL=https://homecontrol-app.azurewebsites.net
#
# Pointing at a local backend instead? Use one of these, and see README.md's
# "Secure cookie + dev TLS" section for the mkcert setup a local backend needs:
#   Android emulator -> host machine:  https://10.0.2.2:7000
#   iOS simulator -> host machine:     https://localhost:7000
#   Physical device over Wi-Fi:        https://<your machine's LAN IP>:7000
